flowchart LR
  U[Reviewer / Operator] --> UI[Dashboard\nHTML + JS + Leaflet]
  UI --> API[FastAPI application]
  API --> DB[(SQLite + SQLAlchemy)]
  API --> MON[Monitoring service\nbackground task]
  MON --> STAC[CDSE STAC catalogue\nexternal]
  MON -. credentials required .-> PROC[CDSE Process API\nexternal]
  MON -. rasterio required .-> GEO[Geospatial preprocessing]
  GEO --> ANALYSE[Baseline analysis\nor optional Siamese U-Net]
  ANALYSE --> DB
  ANALYSE --> ALERT[Alerting + priority]
  ALERT --> DB
  ALERT -. optional SMTP .-> MAIL[Configured email recipient]
  API --> PDF[Case PDF reporting]
  PDF --> U
